# Decisions

Append-only log. One entry per cycle (or whenever a real decision gets made
outside a cycle). Newest entries at the bottom. This is a log, not a
to-do list, so don't reorder or delete past entries.

Each entry: date, what was decided, why, and what it was chosen over if
that's relevant. Future cycles read this before picking a new priority, so
write it for that reader, not just as a record.

